gentina-in-one-of-three-easy-ways-" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Send to Argentina in one of three easy ways <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We never want sending a parcel to be a hassle, which is why we’re constantly investing in the growth of our drop-off network. Whether that’s ParcelShops in your area or more couriers on the road to make a collection. See how you can take advantage:   <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TIypbqstJ9-Te__EVRI_LOCATION_03_2332b7e05.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TIypbqstJ9-Te__EVRI_LOCATION_03_2332b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=38%2C0%2C5923%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TIypbqstJ9-Te__EVRI_LOCATION_03_2332b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=38%2C0%2C5923%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TIypbqstJ9-Te__EVRI_LOCATION_03_2332b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=38%2C0%2C5923%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer in a ParcelShop store handing their packageless parcel to a smiling store assistant." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!---->