6,"end":197,"type":104},{"type":183,"text":254,"spans":255,"direction":92},"Christmas Day - 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[256],{"start":66,"end":257,"type":104},13,{"link_type":157},"card$49c696ff-412f-4067-bfb4-7291d135aa40",{"variation":261,"version":31,"items":262,"primary":324,"id":334,"slice_type":335,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[263,284,304],{"Title":264,"Description":269,"Image":273,"Label":46,"UrlText":279,"Url":280,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":283,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[265],{"type":266,"text":267,"spans":268},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[270],{"type":89,"text":271,"spans":272,"direction":92},"Choose from 9,000+ ParcelShops conveniently located in a neighbourhood near you. Each one equipped with a Print in ParcelShop device, allowing for label printing on-location completely free. Head down today for a quick and easy drop-off.   ",[],{"dimensions":274,"alt":275,"copyright":46,"url":276,"id":277,"edit":278},{"width":78,"height":79},"Customer in a ParcelShop store handing their packageless parcel to a smiling store assistant.","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIypbqstJ9-Te__EVRI_LOCATION_03_2332b.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=38%2C0%2C5923%2C3939&w=1000&h=665","Z6TIypbqstJ9-Te_",{"x":84,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":36,"key":281,"url":282},"1cca406f-27ae-4d09-8f22-677c1b65d1d7","\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":157},{"Title":285,"Description":289,"Image":293,"Label":46,"UrlText":300,"Url":301,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":303,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[286],{"type":266,"text":287,"spans":288},"Lockers",[],[290],{"type":89,"text":291,"spans":292,"direction":92},"With Lockers available across the UK, safe and secure parcel drop-off is right around the corner. Just locate your nearest Locker, scan the barcode, and pop your parcel inside ready to be collected.  ",[],{"dimensions":294,"alt":295,"copyright":46,"url":296,"id":297,"edit":298},{"width":78,"height":79},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":66,"y":299,"zoom":67,"background":68},17,"Locate your nearest Locker",{"link_type":36,"key":302,"url":282},"f1e23d2a-766b-443a-95a6-62e084df1b68",{"link_type":157},{"Title":305,"Description":309,"Image":313,"Label":46,"UrlText":319,"Url":320,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":323,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[306],{"type":266,"text":307,"spans":308},"Couriers",[],[310],{"type":89,"text":311,"spans":312,"direction":92},"Let one of our friendly couriers take care of your parcel by booking a collection. We’ll even give you a 1-hour slot so you’ll know exactly when to expect them. ",[],{"dimensions":314,"alt":315,"copyright":46,"url":316,"id":317,"edit":318},{"width":78,"height":79},"An Evri Courier smiling towards a customer after having completed a doorstep collection. The courier is holding multiple parcels, whilst the customer is holding a blue slip containing the details of the delivery.","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDoZbqstJ9-cff_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4287.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDoZbqstJ9-cff",{"x":66,"y":192,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Book a courier collection today",{"link_type":36,"key":321,"url":322},"f980a8e2-e519-489e-acfb-954b3235624e","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":157},{"SectionTitle":325,"SectionDescription":330,"theme":46},[326],{"type":327,"text":328,"spans":329,"direction":92},"heading2","Send to Argentina in one of three easy ways ",[],[331],{"type":89,"text":332,"spans":333,"direction":92},"We never want sending a parcel to be a hassle, which is why we’re constantly investing in the growth of our drop-off network. Whether that’s ParcelShops in your area or more couriers on the road to make a collection. See how you can take advantage:   ",[],"article_link_module$8c909b79-e19e-4a7d-8e65-e4daad61827d","article_link_module",{"variation":121,"version":31,"items":337,"primary":338,"id":352,"slice_type":119,"slice_label":46},[],{"CardImage":339,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":345,"CardText":346,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":350,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":340,"alt":341,"copyright":46,"url":342,"id":343,"edit":344},{"width":78,"height":79},"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ",{"x":66,"y":192,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Customs made simple with Evri",[347],{"type":89,"text":348,"spans":349,"direction":92},"If you’re worried about customs forms and admin, don’t be! At Evri we take care of all the paperwork for you by processing it all in the background using the information you provide when you make the booking. We even have a lookup function for HS codes, so just tell us what’s in the box and we’ll fill that part in for you. Sending a parcel internationally should be stress free, so make it easy by sending with Evri today.  ",[],{"link_type":36,"key":351,"url":155},"b98f3e26-75c2-4f87-8f65-31d4469f6d02","card$c1d3910c-7ce1-4347-9ab5-34e40a08b7bb",{"variation":121,"version":31,"items":354,"primary":356,"id":398,"slice_type":119,"slice_label":46},[355],{},{"CardImage":357,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":364,"CardText":365,"ButtonText":395,"ButtonUrl":396,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":358,"alt":360,"copyright":46,"url":361,"id":362,"edit":363},{"width":78,"height":359},667,"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Send multiple parcels to Argentina with ease",[366,369,373,376,392],{"type":89,"text":367,"spans":368,"direction":92},"We’ve made it easy for online sellers and the like to send multiple parcels internationally. Whether it’s a marketplace integration or a CSV upload, you can save time and hassle by following these simple steps:  ",[],{"type":370,"text":371,"spans":372,"direction":92},"o-list-item","Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file ",[],{"type":370,"text":374,"spans":375,"direction":92},"Package up your items and book your parcels all at once ",[],{"type":370,"text":377,"spans":378,"direction":92},"Print off your postage labels at home or at a ParcelShop using a Print in ParcelShop device ",[379,390],{"start":380,"end":381,"type":99,"data":382},65,92,{"id":383,"type":110,"tags":384,"lang":15,"slug":385,"first_publication_date":386,"last_publication_date":387,"uid":388,"url":389,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"YhadqhIAACsA0rN4",[267],"print-in-parcelshop--print-parcel-labels--evri","2022-02-23T21:16:27+0000","2026-03-18T09:48:59+0000","print-in-parcelshop","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop",{"start":380,"end":391,"type":104},91,{"type":370,"text":393,"spans":394,"direction":92},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ drop off locations across the country or let your courier make a collection. ",[],"Send multiple parcels to Argentina",{"link_type":36,"key":397,"url":38},"e6974bb4-4ba1-4fc3-9fcf-26c634ea06e8","card$93d4bb75-307c-477d-b60c-f6458e923fd2",{"variation":400,"version":31,"items":401,"primary":482,"id":485,"slice_type":486,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[402,421,433,445,458,470],{"title":403,"content":404,"icon":414},"Regular tracking updates",[405],{"type":89,"text":406,"spans":407,"direction":92},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking for you and notifications for your recipient at no extra cost",[408,413],{"start":409,"end":410,"type":99,"data":411},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":412,"target":102},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":409,"end":410,"type":104},{"dimensions":415,"alt":417,"copyright":46,"url":418,"id":419,"edit":420},{"width":416,"height":416},40,"Phone icon","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":422,"content":423,"icon":427},"Parcel cover",[424],{"type":89,"text":425,"spans":426,"direction":92},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":428,"alt":429,"copyright":46,"url":430,"id":431,"edit":432},{"width":416,"height":416},"Money icon","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":434,"content":435,"icon":439},"Customs made easier",[436],{"type":89,"text":437,"spans":438,"direction":92},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":440,"alt":441,"copyright":46,"url":442,"id":443,"edit":444},{"width":416,"height":416},"Passport icon","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":446,"content":447,"icon":451},"Flexible printing options",[448],{"type":89,"text":449,"spans":450,"direction":92},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":452,"alt":453,"copyright":46,"url":454,"id":455,"edit":456},{"width":416,"height":416},"Printer icon","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":457},"#fff",{"title":459,"content":460,"icon":464},"Bulk send",[461],{"type":89,"text":462,"spans":463,"direction":92},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":465,"alt":466,"copyright":46,"url":467,"id":468,"edit":469},{"width":416,"height":416},"Strapped boxes icon","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fb82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsU",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":471,"content":472,"icon":476},"Trusted by top UK brands",[473],{"type":89,"text":474,"spans":475,"direction":92},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":477,"alt":478,"copyright":46,"url":479,"id":480,"edit":481},{"width":416,"height":416},"Success icon","argentina.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":483,"title":484,"description":46},"standard","Why send internationally with Evri?","list_block$5561303f-d955-4b8d-a3c8-2302fd07d450","list_block",{"variation":173,"version":31,"items":488,"primary":490,"id":503,"slice_type":119,"slice_label":46},[489],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":491,"CardText":492,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":502,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Argentina",[493],{"type":89,"text":494,"spans":495,"direction":92},"Our channels are open to a great variety of items, however there are a few things that you can’t send internationally with Evri. Check out a comprehensive list of what you can and can’t send to make sure your items are safe for transit. ",[496,501],{"start":497,"end":498,"type":99,"data":499},163,190,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":500},"_self",{"start":497,"end":498,"type":104},{"link_type":157},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":173,"version":31,"items":505,"primary":507,"id":565,"slice_type":119,"slice_label":46},[506],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":508,"CardText":509,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":563,"IsEco":20},"How to format an address when sending to Argentina",[510,513,516,519,522,525,528,531,534,538,543,547,551,555,560],{"type":89,"text":511,"spans":512,"direction":92},"When you send a parcel to Argentina, you’ll need to follow the correct address structure: ",[],{"type":183,"text":514,"spans":515,"direction":92},"Recipient’s name ",[],{"type":183,"text":517,"spans":518,"direction":92},"Street name and house\u002Fbuilding number ",[],{"type":183,"text":520,"spans":521,"direction":92},"Province ",[],{"type":183,"text":523,"spans":524,"direction":92},"City or town ",[],{"type":183,"text":526,"spans":527,"direction":92},"Postcode ",[],{"type":183,"text":529,"spans":530,"direction":92},"ARGENTINA in capital ldetters on the last line of the address ",[],{"type":89,"text":532,"spans":533,"direction":92},"For example: ",[],{"type":89,"text":535,"spans":536,"direction":92},"Mr  J. Bloggs ",[537],{"start":66,"end":257,"type":104},{"type":89,"text":539,"spans":540,"direction":92},"Calle Florida 567, Departamento 4B ",[541],{"start":66,"end":542,"type":104},34,{"type":89,"text":544,"spans":545,"direction":92},"Buenos Aires Province ",[546],{"start":66,"end":197,"type":104},{"type":89,"text":548,"spans":549,"direction":92},"Buenos Aires ",[550],{"start":66,"end":202,"type":104},{"type":89,"text":552,"spans":553,"direction":92},"C1005AAK ",[554],{"start":66,"end":192,"type":104},{"type":89,"text":556,"spans":557,"direction":92},"ARGENTINA ",[558],{"start":66,"end":559,"type":104},9,{"type":89,"text":561,"spans":562,"direction":92},"But don’t worry, just enter the correct address information at checkout, and we’ll ensure it’s formatted correctly when you print your label. ",[],{"link_type":36,"key":564,"url":155},"e883c23c-2067-4b01-921e-7be469f61f22","card$01a6a053-7981-4f82-bc6b-1ba7078276c6",{"variation":121,"version":31,"items":567,"primary":603,"id":605,"slice_type":606,"slice_label":46},[568,574,586],{"questionTitle":569,"questionBody":570},"How long does it take to send a parcel to Argentina?",[571],{"type":89,"text":572,"spans":573,"direction":92},"A parcel to Argentina once dropped off at a ParcelShop or Locker should take around 14-17 days to arrive at its destination. ",[],{"questionTitle":575,"questionBody":576},"Can I track my parcels to Argentina?",[577],{"type":89,"text":578,"spans":579,"direction":92},"Absolutely. We offer end-to-end tracking on all our parcels for no additional cost. Simply input your tracking number on our international tracking page and you’ll be able to see your parcel’s progress.  ",[580,585],{"start":581,"end":582,"type":99,"data":583},125,152,{"link_type":36,"url":584,"target":102},"argentina.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":581,"end":582,"type":104},{"questionTitle":587,"questionBody":588},"Are there any import taxes to pay on a parcel from the UK to Argentina?",[589,592,595],{"type":89,"text":590,"spans":591,"direction":92},"When sending parcels to Argentina, you may need to pay customs fees and VAT. The amount can vary depending on the destination, purpose, and value of your parcel. ",[],{"type":89,"text":593,"spans":594,"direction":92},"If your recipient needs to pay customs duty, remember to let them know. We’ll contact your recipient and share a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items. ",[],{"type":89,"text":596,"spans":597,"direction":92},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information. ",[598,602],{"start":599,"end":380,"type":99,"data":600},30,{"link_type":36,"url